tate":"3","role":0,"stats":[63,52,41,40,53,76],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1005702","armor":"WP1006405","helmet":"WP1023105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10915","name":{"zh":"北伐中原","en":"Northern Expedition"},"year":"227","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1009","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[63,52,41,40,53,76],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1005702","armor":"WP1006405","helmet":"WP1023105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1009","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[63,52,41,40,53,76],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1005702","armor":"WP1006405","helmet":"WP1023105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1009","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[63,52,41,40,53,76],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1005702","armor":"WP1006405","helmet":"WP1023105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1009","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[63,52,41,40,53,76],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1005702","armor":"WP1006405","helmet":"WP1023105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1009","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[63,52,41,40,53,76],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"98","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1005702","armor":"WP1006405","helmet":"WP1023105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10060","city":"CS1009","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[63,52,41,40,53,76],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"98","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1005702","armor":"WP1006405","helmet":"WP1023105"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"袁绍麾下武将。兴平二年，公孙瓒与袁绍争夺冀州控制权时，季雍举鄃县投降公孙瓒，并接受其任命继续担任县令。公孙瓒随即派军队驻守鄃县，以巩固对冀州西部的控制。袁绍为夺回失地，派遣朱灵率军攻打鄃县。朱灵与季雍苦战多日，最终攻破城池，活捉季雍。","tc":"袁紹麾下武將。興平二年，公孫瓚與袁紹爭奪冀州控制權時，季雍舉鄃縣投降公孫瓚，并接受其任命繼續擔任縣令。公孫瓚隨即派軍隊駐守鄃縣，以鞏固對冀州西部的控制。袁紹為奪回失地，派遣朱靈率軍攻打鄃縣。朱靈與季雍苦戰多日，最終攻破城池，活捉季雍。","en":"An officer under Yuan Shao. In the 2nd year of Xingping, during the struggle between Gongsun Zan and Yuan Shao for control of Ji Province, Ji Yong surrendered Yu County to Gongsun Zan and accepted his appointment to continue serving as Magistrate. Gongsun Zan promptly stationed troops in Yu County to consolidate his hold on western Ji Province. To reclaim the lost territory, Yuan Shao dispatched Zhu Ling to attack Yu County. After days of fierce fighting, Zhu Ling eventually breached the city walls and captured Ji Yong alive.","jp":"袁紹配下の武将。興平二年、公孫瓚と袁紹が冀州の支配権を争った際、季雍は鄃県を挙げて公孫瓚に降伏し、その任官を受けて引き続き県令を務めた。公孫瓚は直ちに軍を派遣して鄃県に駐屯させ、冀州西部に対する支配を固めようとした。袁紹は失地を奪還すべく、朱霊に軍を率いさせて鄃県を攻めさせた。朱霊は季雍と数日に及ぶ苦戦の末、ついに城を攻め落とし、季雍を生け捕りにした。","kr":"원소 휘하의 무장. 흥평 2년, 공손찬과 원소가 기주의 지배권을 두고 다툴 때 계옹은 유현을 들어 공손찬에게 항복했고, 그의 임명을 받아 현령직을 계속 맡았다. 공손찬은 곧바로 유현에 군사를 주둔시켜 기주 서부에 대한 지배를 공고히 하려 했다. 원소는 잃은 땅을 되찾기 위해 주령을 파견해 군사를 이끌고 유현을 공격하게 했다. 주령은 계옹과 여러 날 동안 고전을 치른 끝에 마침내 성을 함락시키고 계옹을 생포했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10739","remark":"","surname":"季","surnameTc":"季","surnameEn":"Ji","surnameJp":"季","surnameKr":"계","surnameOther":"","name":"雍","nameTc":"雍","nameEn":"Yong","nameJp":"雍","nameKr":"옹","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"季雍","power":"WJ10060","rejectPower":"","reject